# Changelog

## [1.0.2] - 2026-11-09

### Changed
- Updated package version metadata.
- Inspector tooltips for `includeInactive` of the listeners and XML summaries for `EyeTrackingBehaviour`, `EyeTrackingStatementComposer` and `EyeTrackingTargetListener`. Both appear on docs.omilaxr.dev.

## [1.0.1] - 2025-12-17

### Added
- `CHANGELOG`, `CITATION.cff` and `LICENSE` files with their `.meta` files.

## [1.0.0] - 2025-05-21

First release of OmiLAXR.MRTK2.

### Added
- `ManipulationTrackingBehaviour` with `ObjectManipulatorListener` and `ManipulationStatementComposer` for MRTK2 object manipulation.
- `EyeTrackingBehaviour` with `GazeDetection`, `EyeTrackingTargetListener`, `GazeDetectionListener` and `EyeTrackingStatementComposer` for MRTK2 eye tracking.
- `MenuTrackingBehaviour` with `ButtonConfigHelperListener` and `MenuStatementComposer` for MRTK2 menus and buttons.
- `MRTK2LearnerPipelineExtension` and `MRTK2DataProviderExtension` to plug the module into the OmiLAXR pipeline and data provider.
- `ReenablePipelinesOnSceneLoad` helper.
- Prefabs under `Resources/Prefabs`, including `Learning Analytics (MRTK2)` and MRTK2 variants of the OmiLAXR and OmiLAXR.xAPI prefabs.